title: Eventos del foco II
max-visits: 1
view-if: 0
# Container/namespace only. The march's inner life, all of it chained: the doctor, the phantom
# informer, the hunger, the ones who leave, the camp found. Every event is a first decision that
# opens a second, and a conclusion computed from both plus the state of the column and the water.

# =====================================================================
# EL MÉDICO — where you put him, and then the night it is tested.
# =====================================================================
@ev_medico
title: El médico
new-page: true
face-image: img/guerillasmile.jpg
subtitle: A rifle that heals, and one more person who knows where you sleep
tags: event
view-if: banda = "sierra" and f_phase = "marcha" and f_medico = 0 and f_bajas >= 2 and time >= f_ev_last + 2
priority: 5
frequency: 60
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {! Q.f_ev_last=Q.time; Q.ch_p1=""; Q.ch_p2=""; Q.ch_res=""; !}

= El médico

He comes up the mountain the way Che once did, and with the same problem: soft hands, city shoes, and an absolute conviction that he is going to be useful.

He is twenty-six. He can keep your wounded alive, which nobody in this column has managed to do. He can also do the thing that wins more of the sierra than any ambush ever has — hold a clinic in hamlets that have never in their entire history seen a doctor, and let people learn that the guerrilla is the only power that ever brought them medicine instead of taking their sons.

He is a rifle that heals. He is also one more person who knows where you sleep, and he is not trained for any of that part.

- @med_columna: Keep him with the column. Your wounded stop dying and the band gets its soul back. *(fewer casualties; +moral)*
- @med_pueblos: Send him through the villages with a kit and a boy to carry it. *(the deepest water there is; your own wounded keep suffering)*
- @med_formar: Neither. Have him spend six months training twenty campesinas as health workers, and then he is replaceable. *(slow; it outlives him, and it outlives you)*

@med_columna
new-page: true
go-to: foco_eventos2.med_noche
on-arrival: {! Q.ch_p1="columna"; Q.f_medico=1; Q.f_moral+=8; Q.leyenda=(Q.leyenda||0)+3; Q.f_bajas=0; Q.che_advisor=1; !}

@med_pueblos
new-page: true
go-to: foco_eventos2.med_noche
