@med_formar
new-page: true
go-to: foco_eventos2.med_noche
on-arrival: {! Q.ch_p1="formar"; Q.f_medico=1; var _h=Math.max(0,(Q.apoyo_techo||55)-(Q.apoyo_popular||0)); Q.apoyo_popular+=Math.min(7,_h*0.4); Q.sup_peasants=(Q.sup_peasants||0)+4; Q.zona_gobernada=1; Q.disciplina=(Q.disciplina||65)+3; Q.f_moral+=3; !}

@med_noche
title: La noche que se prueba
new-page: true
face-image: img/countrysideravine.jpg

= La noche que se prueba

It is tested in November, at two in the morning, on a compañero everybody likes.

A femoral wound, four hours old, tourniquet on since the ambush, and the leg below it is already the colour that means the argument is over. The doctor says the sentence he has clearly been dreading having to say up here: he can do it, but not in a ramada by candlelight with no blood and no anaesthetic beyond what is in the bottle.

There is a hospital in Atoyac. It is forty kilometres and a checkpoint away, and every hospital in this state has a standing instruction to report gunshot wounds to the garrison.

[? if ch_p1 = "pueblos" : And the doctor is not here. He is four valleys away holding a clinic, which was your decision, and somebody is going to have to go and find him and it is going to take nine hours. ?][? if ch_p1 = "formar" : Two of the women he has been training are here, which is not nothing, and they are honest about exactly how much it is: they can hold a light and they can keep him breathing and they cannot do this. ?]

- @med_n_hospital: Take him to Atoyac. Papers, a borrowed truck, a story, and whatever happens happens. *(a real chance for him; a thread straight into the garrison)*
- @med_n_campo: Do it here. Candlelight, a table, and the doctor's hands. *(he probably lives without the leg; he may not live)*
- @med_n_esperar: Nothing. Make him comfortable and sit with him. *(the oldest decision in guerrilla medicine, and the one nobody writes down)*

@med_n_hospital
go-to: foco_eventos2.med_fin
on-arrival: {! Q.ch_p2="hospital"; !}

@med_n_campo
go-to: foco_eventos2.med_fin
on-arrival: {! Q.ch_p2="campo"; !}

@med_n_esperar
go-to: foco_eventos2.med_fin
on-arrival: {! Q.ch_p2="esperar"; !}

@med_fin
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
var _p1=Q.ch_p1||"", _p2=Q.ch_p2||"", _apoyo=Q.apoyo_popular||0;
var _cal = ((_p1==="columna")?22:((_p1==="formar")?10:0)) + (_apoyo*0.3) - ((Q.brutalidad||0)*3);
var _r = _cal + Math.random()*40-18;
if(_p2==="hospital"){ Q.ch_res=(_apoyo>=45 && _r>=8)?"hosp_bien":"hosp_mal"; }
else if(_p2==="campo"){ Q.ch_res=(_r>=6)?"campo_bien":"campo_mal"; }
else { Q.ch_res="esperar"; }
var R=Q.ch_res;
if(R==="hosp_bien"){ Q.f_moral+=10; Q.leyenda=(Q.leyenda||0)+2; var _h=Math.max(0,(Q.apoyo_techo||55)-_apoyo); Q.apoyo_popular+=Math.min(6,_h*0.35); Q.estado_intel=(Q.estado_intel||0)+4; }
if(R==="hosp_mal"){ Q.f_hombres-=1; Q.f_bajas=(Q.f_bajas||0)+1; Q.memorial=(Q.memorial||0)+2; Q.f_moral-=10; Q.estado_intel=(Q.estado_intel||0)+16; Q.f_cerco+=16; Q.expediente=(Q.expediente||0)+8; }
if(R==="campo_bien"){ Q.f_moral+=6; Q.disciplina=(Q.disciplina||65)+3; Q.f_bajas=Math.max(0,(Q.f_bajas||0)-1); }
if(R==="campo_mal"){ Q.f_hombres-=1; Q.f_bajas=(Q.f_bajas||0)+1; Q.memorial=(Q.memorial||0)+2; Q.f_moral-=8; }
if(R==="esperar"){ Q.f_hombres-=1; Q.f_bajas=(Q.f_bajas||0)+1; Q.memorial=(Q.memorial||0)+2; Q.f_moral-=6; Q.disciplina=(Q.disciplina||65)+2; }
if(Q.f_cerco>100){Q.f_cerco=100;} if(Q.f_moral<0){Q.f_moral=0;} if(Q.f_hombres<0){Q.f_hombres=0;}
if(Q.f_hombres<=0){Q.f_fin_foco=1;Q.members=0;}
!}

= Al amanecer

[? if ch_res = "hosp_bien" : It works, and it works because of a chain of people none of whom had to do it: a man with a truck, a nurse who wrote a different word on a form, an orderly who lost a page, a doctor on nights who looked at the entry wound and asked nothing at all. He keeps the leg. He is back in the column in five months walking badly, and every one of those people took a risk with their own life for somebody they had never met. That is what the water actually is. It is not a statistic. It is a specific nurse. ?][? if ch_res = "hosp_mal" : The hospital does what the hospital is instructed to do. Somebody makes a telephone call while he is still on the table, and by the time the truck is back in the sierra there are two men from the DFS in the corridor being extremely patient. He does not come back. What they get out of the file is not much on its own — a date, a wound, a description of two people — but it is the first hard, documented thing they have ever had, and files are built out of first hard things. ?][? if ch_res = "campo_bien" : It is done on a table made of a door, by candlelight, with four people holding him and a strap of leather in his teeth, and it takes fifty minutes and it is the worst thing anybody in this column has ever had to be in the room for. He lives. He is furious about the leg for a year and then he is the person who runs the camp's stores better than anyone ever has, and he is *here*, which at four in the morning in November did not look likely. ?][? if ch_res = "campo_mal" : It is done on a table made of a door and it is not enough. There was never really a version of this where a man with that wound and four hours of tourniquet walks away from a candlelit ramada, and the doctor knows it and says so afterwards, once, quietly, and then does not say it again. He is buried above the camp. The column is very careful with the doctor for a while, in the way people are careful with someone they have asked to do something unforgivable. ?][? if ch_res = "esperar" : You sit with him. That is the entire content of the decision and it takes until about half past four.[? if ch_p1 = "pueblos" :  The doctor arrives at nine, having walked all night, and there is nothing for him to do, and he takes it badly in a way that suggests nobody warned him this would be most of the job. ?] Every guerrilla war has an enormous number of these nights in it and almost none of them appear in any account, because there is no decision in them and no lesson and nothing that can be improved on next time. There is a man, and then there is not. The column marches at six. ?]

- @root: Continuar.

# =====================================================================
# EL FANTASMA DEL INFORMANTE — the fever, the search, and what is actually leaking.
# =====================================================================
@ev_purga
title: El fantasma del informante
new-page: true
face-image: img/guardias_blancas.jpg
subtitle: The enemy's deepest victory is the traitor you invent
tags: event
view-if: banda = "sierra" and f_phase = "marcha" and paranoia >= 45 and time >= f_purga_last + 4
priority: 6
frequency: 70
max-visits: 5
on-arrival: {! Q.f_purga_last=Q.time; Q.ch_p1=""; Q.ch_p2=""; Q.ch_res="";
// WHAT IS ACTUALLY WRONG. The player never gets told this directly. 0 = nothing (fear), 1 = a real
// human leak, 2 = the radio, which is technical and nobody suspects it.
var _r=Math.random();
Q.ch_n1 = (_r<0.5) ? 0 : ((_r<0.78) ? 1 : 2);
!}

= El fantasma del informante

It does not arrive as a fact. It arrives as a *fever.*

Three operations in a row have gone wrong. Twice the army has been somewhere it had no business being. And in a column that stopped sleeping properly about eight months ago, the mind does the thing frightened minds do, which is look for a face — because a face can be dealt with, and bad luck cannot.

A veteran you trust brings you a name in a low voice, and behind it there is nothing but coincidence and fear, and behind it there is also everything, because this is what killed more guerrillas than the Mexican army ever managed. The Bolivian diary is full of it. So is the Liga's short history. The enemy's deepest victory is not the informer he plants. It is the ones you invent to explain your losses.

- @pur_actuar: Act on the name. In a war this tight you cannot afford to be wrong slowly. *(the purge; the column begins to eat itself)*
- @pur_buscar: Refuse the fever. Find out what is actually leaking, in the cold, methodically. *(needs discipline; the answer may not be a person)*
- @pur_hablar: Stand in front of the whole column and refuse it out loud, publicly, on your own authority. *(costs you; holds the band together)*

@pur_actuar
new-page: true
go-to: foco_eventos2.pur_fin
on-arrival: {! Q.ch_p1="actuar"; Q.ch_p2="ninguna"; !}

@pur_hablar
new-page: true
go-to: foco_eventos2.pur_fin
on-arrival: {! Q.ch_p1="hablar"; Q.ch_p2="ninguna"; !}

@pur_buscar
new-page: true
face-image: img/charola.jpg
choose-if: disciplina >= 45
unavailable-subtitle: A column this frightened and this loose cannot investigate calmly. It can only accuse.
on-arrival: {! Q.ch_p1="buscar"; Q.inteligencia=(Q.inteligencia||0)+3; !}

= Lo que de verdad se está filtrando

You do it properly, which takes eleven days and makes you deeply unpopular: every one of the three failures reconstructed hour by hour, who knew what and when, and who could not possibly have known.

[? if ch_n1 = 0 : And at the end of it there is nothing. The three operations failed for three unrelated and entirely boring reasons — a patrol that was where it was by accident, an order given too loudly in a village at midday, and one occasion on which the army was simply competent. There is no informer. There has never been an informer. There is a frightened column that needed its losses to have a face. ?][? if ch_n1 = 1 : And at the end of it there is a person, and it is not the person who was named. It is a compañero taken at a checkpoint in March, who everybody assumed was dead, and who has been alive in a cell in Acapulco for seven months answering questions in exchange for not being taken up in an aircraft. He is not a traitor. He is a man who has been in a room with those people for seven months. ?][? if ch_n1 = 2 : And at the end of it, it is not a person at all. It is the radio. The transmissions are being direction-found — somebody in a truck with a loop aerial and a great deal of patience — and the pattern of the three failures maps exactly onto the three longest broadcasts. Nobody betrayed anything. You have been telling them where you are, twice a month, for a year, in a code they did not even need to break. ?]

- @pur_b_actuar: [? if ch_n1 = 0 : Say so, plainly, to the whole column. There is no traitor and there never was. ?][? if ch_n1 = 1 : Get word to him that the column knows, and forgives it, and that he should tell them whatever keeps him alive. ?][? if ch_n1 = 2 : Change everything — short transmissions, moving sets, new schedules. Fix the actual hole. ?]
- @pur_b_callar: Say nothing about what you found. Let the fear disperse on its own and keep the finding to yourself. *(nobody's name is cleared; nobody's is dirtied either)*

@pur_b_actuar
go-to: foco_eventos2.pur_fin
on-arrival: {! Q.ch_p2="actuar"; !}

@pur_b_callar
go-to: foco_eventos2.pur_fin
on-arrival: {! Q.ch_p2="callar"; !}

@pur_fin
new-page: true
face-image: img/muertos.jpg
on-arrival: {!
var _p1=Q.ch_p1||"", _p2=Q.ch_p2||"", _c=Q.ch_n1||0;
if(_p1==="actuar"){ Q.ch_res=(_c===1)?"purga_acerto":"purga_erro"; }
else if(_p1==="hablar"){ Q.ch_res="hablar"; }
else { Q.ch_res = (_p2==="callar") ? "buscar_callar" : ("buscar_"+_c); }
var R=Q.ch_res;
if(R==="purga_acerto"){ Q.brutalidad=(Q.brutalidad||0)+2; Q.ajusticiamientos=(Q.ajusticiamientos||0)+1; Q.disciplina=(Q.disciplina||65)-8; Q.f_moral-=6; Q.paranoia=(Q.paranoia||45)+4; Q.f_hombres-=1; Q.f_bajas=(Q.f_bajas||0)+1; Q.apoyo_popular-=3; }
if(R==="purga_erro"){ Q.brutalidad=(Q.brutalidad||0)+3; Q.ajusticiamientos=(Q.ajusticiamientos||0)+1; Q.disciplina=(Q.disciplina||65)-16; Q.f_moral-=14; Q.paranoia=(Q.paranoia||45)+14; Q.f_hombres-=2; Q.f_bajas=(Q.f_bajas||0)+2; Q.apoyo_popular-=6; }
if(R==="hablar"){ Q.paranoia=(Q.paranoia||45)-10; Q.f_moral+=5; Q.disciplina=(Q.disciplina||65)+2; Q.leyenda=(Q.leyenda||0)+1; }
if(R==="buscar_0"){ Q.paranoia=(Q.paranoia||45)-24; Q.disciplina=(Q.disciplina||65)+6; Q.f_moral+=6; }
if(R==="buscar_1"){ Q.paranoia=(Q.paranoia||45)-18; Q.disciplina=(Q.disciplina||65)+5; Q.estado_intel=Math.max(0,(Q.estado_intel||0)-10); Q.f_moral-=3; Q.memorial=(Q.memorial||0)+2; }
if(R==="buscar_2"){ Q.paranoia=(Q.paranoia||45)-22; Q.disciplina=(Q.disciplina||65)+7; Q.estado_intel=Math.max(0,(Q.estado_intel||0)-16); Q.f_cerco-=10; }
if(R==="buscar_callar"){ Q.paranoia=(Q.paranoia||45)-6; Q.disciplina=(Q.disciplina||65)-3; Q.inteligencia=(Q.inteligencia||0)+2; }
if(Q.paranoia<0){Q.paranoia=0;} if(Q.f_cerco<0){Q.f_cerco=0;} if(Q.f_moral<0){Q.f_moral=0;}
if(Q.apoyo_popular<0){Q.apoyo_popular=0;} if(Q.f_hombres<0){Q.f_hombres=0;}
if(Q.f_hombres<=0){Q.f_fin_foco=1;Q.members=0;}
!}

= La mañana siguiente

[? if ch_res = "purga_acerto" : You act, and it stops the leak, because as it happens there was a leak and you happened to point at it. That is the whole of what can honestly be claimed. You did not know. Nobody knew. The column watched a man be shot on the strength of a low-voiced conversation, and the fact that the conversation turned out to be correct does not change what everybody learned, which is that a name is enough. Six people stop volunteering opinions in front of you. You will not notice for about a year. ?][? if ch_res = "purga_erro" : You act, and six weeks later it happens again, in a district where the only suspect is under the ground. Nobody says a word to you about it. Everyone has worked it out. This is how it finishes for the columns the army never catches — not in a firefight but in a clearing at dawn, killing the compañeros the enemy was never able to turn, because it never needed to. ?][? if ch_res = "hablar" : You stand up in front of all of them with the accusation in the open and you refuse it, and you stake your own standing on the single sentence that keeps a guerrilla human: *the day we start killing each other, they have won without firing.* Some of them think you are naive. All of them needed somebody to say it out loud where it could be heard. The fever does not go — fevers do not — but it drops enough to sleep on, and the band holds together another season on nothing but a leader who would not let it turn on itself. ?][? if ch_res = "buscar_0" : You tell them: there is no traitor, there never was, here are eleven days of work showing exactly why each of the three went wrong. And you can watch it land — the specific physical relief of forty people who have been quietly suspecting each other for four months and can stop. The most valuable operation of the year involved no weapons and produced no casualties and consisted entirely of finding out that nothing was wrong. ?][? if ch_res = "buscar_1" : You get word into Acapulco, which costs money and a favour you cannot easily repay, and what comes back is four words from a man in a cell who has been carrying seven months of believing his own compañeros would kill him for it. The leak does not stop — he is still in that room and they still have all afternoon, every afternoon — but the column now knows *where* the hole is, which means it can build around it, and it knows he is not a traitor, which means that when this is all over there will be a version of the story in which he is not one either. ?][? if ch_res = "buscar_2" : You change everything about the radio in one week: transmissions under ninety seconds, the set moved every time, schedules that are not schedules. And the failures stop, immediately and completely, which is its own kind of vindication and also a very cold thing to sit with — because for a year you were handing them your position twice a month, and for four months you had been looking for the person to blame for it, and the person was the arrangement. Somebody would have died for that. ?][? if ch_res = "buscar_callar" : You keep it. You know what is leaking and you tell no one, because telling means explaining how you know, and explaining means people can work out what you looked at and who you looked at it with. The fever cools slowly on its own. Nobody's name is cleared. Two people go on being quietly suspected for the rest of the war by compañeros who will never say so, and one of them will eventually notice, and you will not be able to explain. Command is largely made of these. ?]

- @root: Continuar.

# =====================================================================
# EL HAMBRE — the crisis Bolivia died of, in two decisions.
# =====================================================================
@ev_hambre
title: El hambre
new-page: true
face-image: img/countrysideravine.jpg
subtitle: The enemy that needs no intelligence and takes no prisoners
tags: event
view-if: banda = "sierra" and f_phase = "marcha" and f_comida <= 20 and time >= f_hambre_last + 3
priority: 7
frequency: 100
max-visits: 6
on-arrival: {! Q.f_hambre_last=Q.time; Q.ch_p1=""; Q.ch_p2=""; Q.ch_res=""; !}

= El hambre

The caches are empty and the high sierra has nothing in it in this season, and the column has been on one meal a day for eleven days, and you can see it in the way people are walking.

This is what killed Che in Bolivia as surely as any bullet: a band reduced to boiling roots and shooting its own pack animals, men too weak to march, and a guerrilla that cannot move is not a guerrilla, it is a target sitting down. Hunger needs no intelligence service and takes no prisoners and cannot be ambushed.

Everything you can do about it costs something you would rather keep.

- @ham_convoy: Take a supply convoy. Eat the army's rations off the army's road. *(needs parque; the ring slams shut around the theft)*
- @ham_pueblos: Go down and ask the villages, who have little, and deepen a debt you cannot repay. *(food now; you are living off people poorer than you)*
- @ham_dispersar: Break the column up to forage and survive, and regather when the season turns. *(saves everyone; the foco stops being a foco)*

@ham_convoy
new-page: true
face-image: img/camioneta.jpg
choose-if: f_parque >= 8
unavailable-subtitle: Hitting a convoy takes at least 8 parque, and you are nearly out of that too.
on-arrival: {! Q.ch_p1="convoy"; Q.f_parque-=8; !}

= El convoy

Three trucks and an escort jeep on the Atoyac road at first light, and it is exactly what you need — flour, rice, tinned meat, and if the third truck is what you think it is, ammunition.

The drivers are not soldiers. They are contract men from Coyuca in civilian shirts who do this route because it pays and who have families in a town where you are supposed to have support.

- @ham_c_limpio: Stop it clean. Nobody fires unless fired at, the drivers walk home, and you take the load. *(harder, slower, more risk to you)*
- @ham_c_rapido: Hit it hard and fast and sort out afterwards who was in it. *(certain; the drivers are from Coyuca)*

@ham_c_limpio
go-to: foco_eventos2.ham_fin
on-arrival: {! Q.ch_p2="limpio"; !}

@ham_c_rapido
go-to: foco_eventos2.ham_fin
on-arrival: {! Q.ch_p2="rapido"; !}

@ham_pueblos
new-page: true
face-image: img/elpueblo.jpg
on-arrival: {! Q.ch_p1="pueblos"; !}

= Pedir

You go down and you ask, and the answer is yes before you have finished the sentence, which is the part that is hard to be in the room for.

The problem is which village. The one that has most is the one nearest the road and the most watched, and helping you would be visible. The one that will give most is San Isidro, which has about forty people in it and is the poorest place in the valley and has already given twice this year.

- @ham_p_isidro: Ask San Isidro, who will say yes, because they always say yes. *(you will be fed; think about what you are doing)*
- @ham_p_repartir: Spread it: a very little from every hamlet in the zone, so nobody carries it alone. *(slower and less; nobody is stripped)*
- @ham_p_pagar: Ask, and pay properly — the ransom money, the Party's money, whatever there is. *(costs funds; it is not charity then)*

@ham_p_isidro
go-to: foco_eventos2.ham_fin
on-arrival: {! Q.ch_p2="isidro"; !}

@ham_p_repartir
go-to: foco_eventos2.ham_fin
on-arrival: {! Q.ch_p2="repartir"; !}

@ham_p_pagar
go-to: foco_eventos2.ham_fin
choose-if: funds >= 10
unavailable-subtitle: There is no money. That is a large part of why there is no food.
on-arrival: {! Q.ch_p2="pagar"; Q.funds=(Q.funds||0)-10; !}

@ham_dispersar
new-page: true
on-arrival: {! Q.ch_p1="dispersar"; !}

= Repartirse

Bayo's answer when the choice is scatter or starve: break into groups small enough to live off ground a whole column would strip bare, set a place and a season, and cease to exist until then.

Which leaves the four wounded, who cannot forage and cannot march and cannot be carried by a group of three.

- @ham_d_pueblo: Put the wounded into houses in the villages and trust the sierra with them. *(their risk; and the villages')*
- @ham_d_llevar: Every group takes a wounded man. Slower, hungrier, nobody is left. *(costly; the thing the column will remember)*

@ham_d_pueblo
go-to: foco_eventos2.ham_fin
on-arrival: {! Q.ch_p2="pueblo"; !}

@ham_d_llevar
go-to: foco_eventos2.ham_fin
on-arrival: {! Q.ch_p2="llevar"; !}

@ham_fin
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
var _p1=Q.ch_p1||"", _p2=Q.ch_p2||"", _apoyo=Q.apoyo_popular||0;
var _h=Math.max(0,(Q.apoyo_techo||55)-_apoyo);
if(_p1==="convoy"){
  var _r=(Q.f_hombres||0)*0.5+(Q.f_moral||0)*0.3+_apoyo*0.2-45+(Math.random()*35-12);
  if(_p2==="limpio"){ _r-=8; }
  if(_r>=0){ Q.f_comida+=32; Q.f_parque+=14; Q.f_moral+=6; Q.f_desgaste+=5; Q.ch_res=(_p2==="limpio")?"conv_limpio":"conv_rapido"; }
  else { Q.f_comida+=10; Q.f_hombres-=3; Q.f_bajas=(Q.f_bajas||0)+3; Q.f_moral-=6; Q.memorial=(Q.memorial||0)+1; Q.ch_res="conv_mal"; }
  if(_p2==="limpio"){ Q.apoyo_popular+=Math.min(5,_h*0.3); Q.leyenda=(Q.leyenda||0)+1; }
  else { Q.apoyo_popular-=6; Q.brutalidad=(Q.brutalidad||0)+1; }
  Q.f_cerco+=16;
}
if(_p1==="pueblos"){
  if(_p2==="isidro"){ Q.f_comida+=22; Q.apoyo_popular-=7; Q.sup_peasants=(Q.sup_peasants||0)+1; Q.f_moral-=3; Q.ch_res="isidro"; }
  if(_p2==="repartir"){ Q.f_comida+=13; Q.apoyo_popular+=Math.min(3,_h*0.2); Q.zona_gobernada=1; Q.ch_res="repartir"; }
  if(_p2==="pagar"){ Q.f_comida+=18; Q.apoyo_popular+=Math.min(8,_h*0.45); Q.sup_peasants=(Q.sup_peasants||0)+3; Q.leyenda=(Q.leyenda||0)+2; Q.ch_res="pagar"; }
}
